# Twitching Doll's "Create a 2/2 green Spider creature token with reach for each counter on this creature" counts counters of every
# kind, not only nest counters (CR 122.1, 608.2h). The Doll taps for white on turn 3 (one nest counter) to cast Luminarch Aspirant,
# whose beginning-of-combat trigger puts a +1/+1 counter on the Doll. On turn 5 the Doll, with one nest counter and one +1/+1
# counter, is sacrificed: two green 2/2 Spiders with reach arrive (one if only nest counters were counted).

